WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.470 --> 00:00:02.670
- [Voiceover] Human, are you awake?

00:00:02.670 --> 00:00:03.216
(barking)

00:00:03.216 --> 00:00:03.970
- Oh, hello.

00:00:03.970 --> 00:00:04.876
- [Voiceover] You're awake!

00:00:04.876 --> 00:00:06.049
I love you, I love you, I love you

00:00:06.049 --> 00:00:06.884
- Oh my God, Roxi.

00:00:06.884 --> 00:00:08.429
- [Voiceover] I love you, oh.

00:00:08.429 --> 00:00:09.392
- Do you wanna go on a walk?

00:00:09.392 --> 00:00:11.726
- [Voiceover] Yes! Of
course I wanna go on a walk.

00:00:11.726 --> 00:00:12.771
- Okay, let's go on a walk.

00:00:12.771 --> 00:00:14.524
- [Voiceover] What are you sayin', human?

00:00:14.524 --> 00:00:16.434
Here we go.

00:00:17.101 --> 00:00:18.343
There's no time for that.

00:00:18.343 --> 00:00:19.864
There's no time, you don't need shoes.

00:00:19.864 --> 00:00:21.649
Let's go, I don't wear any shoes,

00:00:21.649 --> 00:00:22.944
what are those?

00:00:23.437 --> 00:00:24.575
Ahh, yes.

00:00:24.575 --> 00:00:26.187
The open air.

00:00:26.187 --> 00:00:27.733
What is that?

00:00:27.733 --> 00:00:28.647
(barking)

00:00:28.647 --> 00:00:29.788
I will save you, human.

00:00:29.788 --> 00:00:30.624
(barking)

00:00:30.624 --> 00:00:33.526
Get outta here, you big piece of metal.

00:00:33.526 --> 00:00:34.328
Goodbye.

00:00:34.328 --> 00:00:35.245
(barking)

00:00:35.245 --> 00:00:36.127
Yeah, I told that.

00:00:36.127 --> 00:00:37.497
- Come on, let's go.

00:00:37.497 --> 00:00:39.215
- [Voiceover] Alright,
here we go, here we go.

00:00:39.215 --> 00:00:42.176
(panting)

00:00:42.176 --> 00:00:44.010
- Let's take your leash off.

00:00:44.010 --> 00:00:46.808
- [Voiceover] (gasp) Yes, I can run.

00:00:46.808 --> 00:00:48.178
I am free.

00:00:48.178 --> 00:00:50.593
I am free as a bird.

00:00:50.593 --> 00:00:53.270
Oh, this is the best.

00:00:54.645 --> 00:00:55.391
Gotta poop.

00:00:55.899 --> 00:00:56.476
Gotta poop.

00:00:56.476 --> 00:00:58.519
Which way is the
gravitational force pulling?

00:00:58.519 --> 00:01:00.528
Oh yes, this is it.

00:01:00.528 --> 00:01:02.929
Nothing like some eye
contact while you're poopin'.

00:01:02.929 --> 00:01:04.522
- Good poops, baby.

00:01:05.819 --> 00:01:08.036
- [Voiceover] Oh, this guy's a cutie.

00:01:08.036 --> 00:01:09.615
I'm gonna set it up for human.

00:01:09.615 --> 00:01:11.914
- Hey, hey there you.

00:01:11.914 --> 00:01:15.119
- No, sorry. This is Roxi.

00:01:15.119 --> 00:01:16.279
- No, its no problem.

00:01:16.279 --> 00:01:17.162
Hey Roxi.

00:01:17.162 --> 00:01:18.126
- [Voiceover] Oh yeah.

00:01:18.126 --> 00:01:19.205
- Aww.

00:01:19.205 --> 00:01:19.797
- Yeah.

00:01:19.797 --> 00:01:20.291
- [Voiceover] She'll thank me later.

00:01:20.291 --> 00:01:20.953
- Hi.

00:01:20.953 --> 00:01:21.591
- I'm Ben.

00:01:21.591 --> 00:01:22.706
- Shantelle.

00:01:22.706 --> 00:01:24.215
- [Voiceover] Oh, what a gorgeous day.

00:01:24.215 --> 00:01:25.213
Who's this?

00:01:25.213 --> 00:01:27.338
Are you my new best friend?

00:01:27.338 --> 00:01:28.220
Hi.

00:01:28.220 --> 00:01:29.878
Wait, I love you.

00:01:29.878 --> 00:01:32.050
I wanna play with her, human.

00:01:32.050 --> 00:01:33.515
What're you doin'?

00:01:33.515 --> 00:01:34.188
- Come on.

00:01:34.188 --> 00:01:35.727
- [Voiceover] Okay, fine.

00:01:36.394 --> 00:01:37.984
- Roxi, you want a treat?

00:01:37.984 --> 00:01:40.353
- [Voiceover] Uh, of
course I want a treat.

00:01:40.353 --> 00:01:41.444
Is that even a question?

00:01:41.444 --> 00:01:42.605
- Good job, baby.

00:01:43.822 --> 00:01:45.981
- [Voiceover] Wait, no,
where are you going?

00:01:45.981 --> 00:01:48.326
- Alright baby, I'll
see you tonight, okay?

00:01:48.326 --> 00:01:48.988
Be good.

00:01:48.988 --> 00:01:50.193
- [Voiceover] Please don't leave.

00:01:50.193 --> 00:01:51.287
Human.

00:01:51.287 --> 00:01:53.329
Please, human.

00:01:53.329 --> 00:01:54.118
No, can I come with you?

00:01:54.118 --> 00:01:58.623
Oh, man, I almost made it that time.

00:01:58.623 --> 00:01:59.912
(barking)

00:01:59.912 --> 00:02:03.909
Oh, but she left the door open.

00:02:04.881 --> 00:02:07.632
Yes, this is my shot.

00:02:07.632 --> 00:02:11.052
Oh, this looks so, yes.

00:02:12.764 --> 00:02:14.935
Oh, and her shoes?

00:02:14.935 --> 00:02:16.142
Oh these are great.

00:02:16.142 --> 00:02:17.727
These look so yummy.

00:02:21.564 --> 00:02:25.198
And the biggest water
bowl in the universe.

00:02:25.198 --> 00:02:27.064
I just want, just a little sip.

00:02:27.064 --> 00:02:28.237
- Oh, hello.

00:02:28.237 --> 00:02:29.862
- [Voiceover] She's home, human.

00:02:29.862 --> 00:02:30.779
You're home.

00:02:30.779 --> 00:02:31.662
- Hi, baby.

00:02:31.662 --> 00:02:32.730
- [Voiceover] Never leave me again.

00:02:32.730 --> 00:02:33.786
- Oh yes.

00:02:33.786 --> 00:02:35.203
- [Voiceover] I missed you so much,

00:02:35.203 --> 00:02:36.329
I promise I was a good girl

00:02:36.329 --> 00:02:38.117
except for the water bowl,
and eating your shoes,

00:02:38.117 --> 00:02:39.545
and going through the trash.

00:02:39.545 --> 00:02:40.578
- Alright.

00:02:40.578 --> 00:02:42.500
- [Voiceover] Never leave again.

